OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder over 'bar punch'
OL,4,Adeath
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied murdering a
OL,7,Fbusinessman who died after he was
OL,8,Freportedly punched at a bar.
OL,10,FBilly Allison, 36, pleaded not guilty
OL,11,Fto the murder of Matthew O'Gara and
OL,12,Fcausing grievous bodily harm at
OL,13,FStafford Crown Court on Tuesday.
OL,15,FO'Gara, a pub director, died in
OL,16,Fhospital two days after police were
OL,17,Fcalled to reports of two men being
OL,18,Fpunched at the Ricco and Loren bar on
OL,19,FMarket Street, Lichfield, on 24 May.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
