OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies murder over 'bar punch'
OL,4,Adeath
OL,5,
OL,6,FAllison, of Cropthorne Road in Shirley,
OL,7,FSolihull, appeared at the court hearing
OL,8,Fvia a video-link, wearing a round neck
OL,9,Fgrey Nike sweater.
